{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2017-11", "window": 3, "start_date": 1510790400, "end_date": 1511395199, "month_true_total": 302, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:13:54 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "36864066", "author": {"steamid": "76561198081285408", "personaname": "SerCamTheIII", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198081285408/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 4241, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3264, "last_played": 1584234421, "avatar": "3299bdcde4ae199e72ee8fd895bcfcf69a2f9adb"}, "language": "english", "review": "A fun game that can be played casually but still bring the excitement. It has artifacts that have classic mini puzzles to find and they totally change the gameplay. The items also are creative and incite the same rogue-lite excitement yu would expect when you get the high tier items. Despite being quite a small game, I have found a lot of replayability and it's always good to come back to.", "timestamp_created": 1511395191, "timestamp_updated": 1511395191, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "36863921", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042094794", "personaname": "Gobob", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/gobob641/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1438, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1438, "last_played": 1459036015, "avatar": "799688fb9848dec779d15e3d9abe25834353ad2e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Doesn't look great, but has very satisfying gameplay.", "timestamp_created": 1511395160, "timestamp_updated": 15113